      "content": "A \"calming influence\" sounds more like a safety net than a driver for growth. We need someone who eats pressure for breakfast, not someone who just survives it. Honestly, if he's too methodical, he'll just be a bottleneck when we need to pivot in an hour. Check his interview transcripts again specifically for any sign of \"hunger\" or aggressive decision-making. Can you honestly say he has the grit to thrive here, or is he just a safe, boring choice?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
